49,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,Ledger Bridge runs in a bank's cycle. It never missed a release.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I am leaning towards Ledger Bridge. It fits our hiring and financial constraints.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,George,,I agree. It matches our successful exit profile.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
